WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
We praise God and we bear witness that there is only one God.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The one true God who created all of us.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
We've been fortunate to receive a message from God

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
that is proven with tangible evidence, physical evidence for the first time in history.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Something that the world is going to recognize, maybe it will take the world 20 years or 50 years.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:48.000
But we are fortunate to be the first pioneers who see this evidence and realize what God is telling us.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
There is a definite message from God to all of us, giving us the most vital information that we need.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
And I will try to draw a picture of the whole thing in this KHUTBAH

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
to summarize for all of us the things that we've been witnessing for the last few years,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.000
and also for our guests to catch up with this... a summary of the whole thing.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
God created us and He did not leave us without support.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.000
He didn't just leave us in the wild without direction or guidance.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:31.000
He did quite a few things to help us attain our objective

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:36.000
which is one of the things that most people don't know.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.000
People in the street, they don't know what our objective is.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:49.000
So, God sent messages and messengers and told us exactly the things that we need.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.000
The first thing that God did was

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.000
that He gathered all of us, all the human beings

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.000
who came to this earth and will come to this earth

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
and that was before creation of the heavens and the earth,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.000
and He had us witness, bear witness that He alone is our Lord,

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.000
that we'll worship God alone.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.000
God called all the people, said, do you bear witness that I am your Lord?

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.000
And we said yes.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.000
So, this constitutes natural instinct in each one of us.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.000
So, each one of us comes to this world, we are born with a natural instinct to worship God alone,

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.000
and not to worship or idolize anybody else.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:39.000
We are born... born with the knowledge and recognition that God is the One who created us,

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.000
that He's the One who provides for us.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.000
He decides exactly how many dollars we're going to get.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:51.000
And God is the One who terminates our life when the specific time comes.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.000
And God is the One who will resurrect us

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.000
and God is the One who will put us in Heaven or Hell depending on our work.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.000
Therefore, we must owe our allegiance to God alone

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.000
and not to any creature.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:08.000
So, this is one of the important things that God did for us.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:14.000
So, what does the average human being need out there in the street? The average person?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.000
The most vital information that first and foremost is who are you?

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
God tells us in this mathematically coded message who we are.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.000
Ask the average person out there who are you?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.000
And they will look in the mirror.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.000
Which is wrong.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Because they think this is us.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:44.000
We come to realize now that each one of us consists of two entities,

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.000
distinct entities: a body and a soul.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.000
And then the soul is the real person,

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.000
that the body is not the person.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.000
The body is a garment that we are wearing.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.000
So, that's who we are.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.000
How many people out there know this?

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:06.000
They have to read God's message with the tangible physical evidence and realize who we are.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
Actually this is an easy matter.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.000
You can logically prove it to anyone.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.000
They realize this body is not us.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.000
They realize there's a difference between a living person and a dead person.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:25.000
The dead person that is not moving, still, does not have a person in it.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.000
It's just a body, a garment.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.000
Something is gone.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:36.000
And this leads to some very important facts.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.000
One fact is, I gave my body breakfast, lunch and dinner yesterday.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.000
What did I give myself?

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:50.000
And this makes us realize that the real person is probably starving.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.000
The real person needs breakfast, lunch and dinner.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:05:00.000
And this is provided in the message that God sent to us.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:07.000
So, this is the first, one of the first items. Who we are? And now we know.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:15.000
The second point that the average person doesn't know out there is Why are we here?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.000
What is the whole idea?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:21.000
Are we here to go to school and study hard and take tests?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:26.000
And put up with parents and teachers and colleagues,

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.000
And then get out and do some work,

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:33.000
work hard from 8:00 to 5:00, go home, watch the TV and then,

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:38.000
go to sleep, get up in the morning, go to work

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
back from work, watch the TV,

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.000
sleep, get up in the morning, go to work... is this what...I mean

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.000
Is this what we are here for?

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.000
What is the whole idea? Why are we here?

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:54.000
And we know the answer from God's message

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.000
that we are here to prepare for the real life

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.000
eternal life.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:03.000
We know that everyone of us is gonna leave here.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.000
We are here temporarily.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.000
Let us say for a 100 years

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:11.000
just to be optimistic or pessimistic, any way you wanna look at it.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.000
If we are here for 100 years, we know that we're gonna go on to something else.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.000
What is this something else?

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.000
God tells us what it is, specifically.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.000
And what it looks like.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.000
And how to prepare for it.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.000
What do we need is another question.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.000
What do we really need?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:42.000
The average person out there is taking care of his or her body.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.000
Whatever the body wants.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.000
The body wants a nice home.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.000
The body wants nice clothes.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.000
The body wants food.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.000
And they are doing that.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:55.000
But they are totally neglecting the real person.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.000
So, what do we need?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.000
God told us exactly what we need.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.000
God didn't just leave us without support.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.000
He gave us the natural instinct to worship Him. He told us who we are,

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.000
why we are here,

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.000
where we're going,

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.000
what does it look on the other side,

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:21.000
and most importantly, how to attain perfect happiness here and forever.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:29.000
This is the most illusive goal for the average person out there: Perfect Happiness.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.000
As it turns out, there are lots of problems in this world.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.000
At home, husbands and wives are fighting.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:41.000
At work, colleagues are fighting with each other. They're jealous of each other. They don't like each other.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.000
Nations at war.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.000
There are lots of problems out there.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:55.000
So, what everyone out there is looking for, this most illusive objective:

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:59.000
how can we attain perfect happiness here and forever?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:03.000
And God tells us exactly how in this message.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:09.000
We now know the secret of happiness because God told us what it is.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.000
Tooboo Ela Allah, Repent.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.000
Alhamdu Lillah, Wa Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.000
We praise God and we bear witness that there is only One true God.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.000
The whole thing started billions of years ago

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:40.000
when Satan thought that he is powerful enough to be a god besides God.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.000
So, here's God with His angels and one of them saying I can be a god, too.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.000
So, how do you prove him wrong or right?

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.000
There's only one way to find out:

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.000
By making him a god, with a small g.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.000
And this is what God decided to do.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:08.000
So, He gave Satan a dominion, the planet earth, and constituents, the human beings,

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:11.000
us, the human beings.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:18.000
We escaped. Ok. Not us but we escaped from Satan, God willing.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:24.000
But the human beings who choose Satan as their god are Satan's constituents.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:27.000
So, now we have a demonstration going on.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.000
And this is one of the things that God teaches us:

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.000
why we are here.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:41.000
There is Satan with a dominion, a piece of land, the planet earth, and constituents, the humans who choose him.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:46.000
So, every human being you look at is either in God's Kingdom or in Satan's kingdom.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:51.000
And Satan is already proven to be incompetent.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:56.000
He should by now declare that he cannot be a god besides God.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:010:03.000
I mean, if he doesn't know it by now, he will know it before the end of the demonstration,

00:010:03.000 --> 00:010:07.000
Satan will declare that yes, I cannot be a god.

00:010:07.000 --> 00:010:09.000
So, this is what we're here for:

00:010:09.000 --> 00:010:13.000
to provide constituents for Satan.

00:010:13.000 --> 00:010:18.000
But the people who choose God as their god are not in Satan's kingdom.

00:010:18.000 --> 00:010:25.000
And this is where the distinction is being drawn between God's Kingdom and Satan's kingdom.

00:010:25.000 --> 00:010:30.000
God's Kingdom has no problems whatsoever.

00:010:30.000 --> 00:010:34.000
When we step out of God's Kingdom, then problems begin.

00:010:36.000 --> 00:010:45.000
Satan's kingdom is full of problems: diseases, cancer, AIDS, accidents, personal problems.

00:010:45.000 --> 00:010:48.000
And these are nonexistent in God's kingdom.

00:010:48.000 --> 00:010:54.000
And there's a mechanism for it that God gave us also in the message.

00:010:54.000 --> 00:010:57.000
What is the mechanism for attaining perfect happiness?

00:011:00.000 --> 00:011:09.000
We've been talking about this and we now know that the secret of perfect happiness is a well-developed and nourished soul.

00:011:09.000 --> 00:011:12.000
A well-developed and nourished person.

00:011:13.000 --> 00:011:20.000
Just as you give your body breakfast, lunch and dinner, the real person, your soul needs breakfast, lunch and dinner.

00:011:20.000 --> 00:011:23.000
So, God tells us exactly how to feed the real person.

00:011:23.000 --> 00:011:27.000
We are doing one of them right now. This is one of the major meals,

00:011:27.000 --> 00:011:30.000
comes once a week, the Friday prayer.

00:011:30.000 --> 00:011:39.000
But the five daily contacts with God are the five daily meals for the person, for the soul, the real you.

00:011:39.000 --> 00:011:42.000
This is one way of attaining this perfect happiness.

00:011:42.000 --> 00:011:46.000
At the same time, you're preparing for the real life

00:011:46.000 --> 00:011:49.000
because that day is going to come

00:011:49.000 --> 00:011:57.000
when you begin the real life and you'll be assigned an eternal rank depending on your degree of development and growth.

00:011:59.000 --> 00:012:02.000
And you know the other things that are written in this brochure:

00:012:02.000 --> 00:012:09.000
the five daily contact prayers, the charity,

00:012:09.000 --> 00:012:12.000
taking from your body to give to the poor. Your body loves money.

00:012:12.000 --> 00:012:14.000
The body wants money.

00:012:14.000 --> 00:012:20.000
So, the charity is designed to take from this body and give away to the poor.

00:012:22.000 --> 00:012:26.000
Fasting is designed to make you the boss over your body.

00:012:27.000 --> 00:012:32.000
A lot of people out there, most of them are enslaved to the body. Whatever the body wants, they go after it.

00:012:32.000 --> 00:012:35.000
The body wants food. Ok.

00:012:35.000 --> 00:012:37.000
The body wants sex. Ok.

00:012:37.000 --> 00:012:38.000
No bounds.

00:012:38.000 --> 00:012:41.000
The body wants clothes. Yes sir.

00:012:41.000 --> 00:012:51.000
So, these commandments from God are designed to make us happy, to make us the boss over the body.

00:012:51.000 --> 00:012:58.000
So, fasting, you'll tell your body you're not gonna eat or drink until sunset, in a specific period.

00:012:58.000 --> 00:013:06.000
And then the fifth is pilgrimage to commemorate Abraham's exemplary submission to God.

00:013:09.000 --> 00:013:16.000
So, this, in a nutshell, the picture of what God did to inform us,

00:013:16.000 --> 00:013:25.000
and like I said, we are fortunate that the information that comes to us from God is supported by the evidence that it is from God.

00:013:25.000 --> 00:013:31.000
There is so much information out there, you don't know which one is correct and which is man-made.

00:013:33.000 --> 00:013:40.000
Is it the book of Mormons? Is it the book of the Bahai's? Is it the Gospel? Is it the Bible? Is it the Torah? Is it the Psalms? What is it?

00:013:40.000 --> 00:013:46.000
So, some of those are books of God and they have the mathematical code in them.

00:013:46.000 --> 00:013:50.000
And we are fortunate to have the complete and intact message from God

00:013:50.000 --> 00:013:54.000
that let's us have 100% confidence in it.

00:013:54.000 --> 00:013:56.000
Aqem Al-Salat

00:013:56.000 --> 00:013:59.000
Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar La Elaha Ella Allah

